From 3443c7ad581c4ec236e189fa818f673a9b63f212 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Isaku Yamahata <isaku.yamahata@intel.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Dec 2021 18:20:37 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 010/115] KVM: TDX: restore user ret MSRs

